    "Synthetic Chrome Trace fixture for test-sycl-timeline-gap-class-conservation.py.",
    "Hand-built, never captured from hardware. The device timestamps are chosen so",
    "that the device0/compute queue produces exactly one gap of each class, and so",
    "that per-gap rounding disagrees with whole-queue rounding by a non-zero amount:",
    "each gap is N000.5 us, which parse-sycl-timeline.py rounds down per gap but",
    "sums to 6001.5 us -> 6002 for the queue total. That makes rounding_delta 2,",
    "so the metric under test is provably observing something.",
    "The device0/copy queue is a clean second queue (rounding_delta 0)."
